# Prettier also reads .gitignore by default, so node_modules/ and venv/ need no
# entry here. This file is only for tracked paths the format gate must not own.

# release-please generates these from commit history on every run: it emits `*`
# list markers and a blank line Prettier removes, and any fix is overwritten by
# the next release. Gating generated output would redden every release PR on a
# diff no edit survives. The root CHANGELOG.md is not here — it is hand-authored
# and stays under the gate.
skills/*/CHANGELOG.md
